Name: zx (Google Shell Scripting for Bun.$)
Short Name: zx
URL: https://github.com/google/zx
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 8.5.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/zx
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/zx

Description:
A tool for writing better scripts developed by Google, providing concise syntax for child processes and pipelines.

Local Modifications:
- Powered by native Bun.$ shell, Bun.Glob, and Bun.file with zero Node.js child_process overhead.
- Exposed via yolo-bun:google-stack and yolo-bun:zx.
